+# PRD: Clear backlog status and reliable update flow
+
+Status: draft
+Gate: PRD
+Gate approval: open
+Based on: UR
+Date: 2026-10-09
+Owner: Arndt Gold
+Run: backlog-status-flow-clarity-20261009-01
