+| Code quality | code-review | pass — scoped source corrections and meaningful regression evidence |
+| QA decision | qa-gate — sole decision owner | pass — current native obligation is fulfilled; no applicable normalized finding remains open |
+
+## Decision
+
+- decision: pass
+- run_id: backlog-status-flow-clarity-20261009-01
+- assessed_revision_id: 9c57e245-d364-47ea-865e-8a6fc3cd9c94
